<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_institution">ByteDance</span>, <span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_country">China</span>
